 "how_to_draw": "pen at (x, y): for each character draw its cell (x, y, w, h) at (pen_x + xoff, y + yoff), then pen_x += advance (space: space_advance). The cap top of the line is y + cap_top, so to put a cap top at Y use y = Y - cap_top. Recolour with canvas globalCompositeOperation 'source-in' and a palette colour; never scale by a fraction.",
